    <selectionEntry type="unit" import="true" name="Brôkhyr Void-Weave Projector" hidden="false" id="121b-d48b-a212-de46" publicationId="e1a3-795b-be05-784b">
      <rules>
        <rule name="Void-Hardened Construction" id="5c85-4918-451f-b40b" hidden="false">
          <description>This Fortification has Armoured Ceramite: enemy weapons with the Melta special rule do not roll extra armour penetration dice against it</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Projected Void-Weave Dome (12&quot;)" id="7db1-7902-448f-bcbe" hidden="false">
          <description>The Brôkhyr Void-Weave Projector's Void Shields form a 12" protective dome centred on the Fortification. Any shooting attack originating outside this 12" radius that targets the Brôkhyr Void-Weave Projector, or any friendly Legiones Votann unit where the target unit is wholly within 12" of the Brôkhyr Void-Weave Projector or where a line drawn from the firing model to the target passes through the 12" radius of the dome, must first resolve its hits against the active Void Shields (AV 12) before allocating any remaining hits to the target unit. If a Barrage weapon fired from outside the dome scatters its Blast marker over a unit inside the dome (or over the Brôkhyr Void-Weave Projector itself), the hits are still resolved against the active Void Shields first. Attacks made by an enemy unit inside the 12" radius at a target also inside it are not intercepted by the Void Shields</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Brôkhyr Capacitor Cycle" id="6aad-9359-5527-bbe5" hidden="false">
          <description>At the end of each friendly Shooting phase, if the Brôkhyr Void-Weave Projector has at least one collapsed Void Shield and did not fire any weapons during that phase, roll a D6: on a 5+ (or 4+ if a friendly model with the Battlesmith (X) special rule is within 3" of the Projector), 1 collapsed Void Shield is immediately restored</description>
        </rule>
        <rule name="Note" id="31b5-8b30-8bd0-8684" hidden="false">
          <description>A heavy, subterranean-anchored field generator forged by Brôkhyr Iron-masters to project multi-layered void-weave domes over Kin oathbands, Land Fortresses, and critical claim-zones.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <categoryLinks>
        <categoryLink targetId="36c3-e85e-97cc-c503" id="5000-1609-1c79-fcce" primary="false" name="Unit:" />
      </categoryLinks>
